    "slug": "ondc-ecommerce-sellers-to-d2c",
    "title": "From Seller to Brand: How Fastlaunch Helps ONDC Sellers & E-Commerce Sellers Build Their Own D2C",
    "subtitle": "Stop renting space on platforms. Start building a brand that belongs to you.",
    "date": "Jul 27, 2026",
